\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>     </p>\n</div></div>",
